OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mendelssohn
OL,6,     F2/5. Kate Molleson follows
OL,7,     FMendelssohn's first visit to
OL,8,     FLondon and his rise to celebrity
OL,9,     Fstatus.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FPetroc Trelawny with live music
OL,12,     Ffrom the Meraki Duo (flute and
OL,13,     Fguitar), whose debut album is out
OL,14,     Fnext month, and hears from oud
OL,15,     Fplayer Yasamin Shahhosseini ahead
OL,16,     Fof her EIF gig.
